Z||000000||Black88GT||02-05-2001||04:02 PM||||I must share two experiences I have had recently with forum members.  First, Roy (mrfixit58) sent me 2 Tampa newspapers with the Ravens victory on it.  Free of charge, I didn't even ask he offered to do it.  Second, Carl (haze performance) sent me a pontiac steering wheel button for free.  I still really can't get over this.<P>Would I find this type of hospitatility in a Corvette forum, or a Honda forum? Certainly not.  It really goes to show that fiero owners, especially forum members, are downright good people...<P>thanks again to Carl and Roy....<P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/cartmanico.gif">             <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/kennyico.gif">           <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/stanico.gif">         <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/kyleico.gif">             <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/chefico.gif"> ||||reg||14
