Z||000003||Formula88||02-05-2001||06:00 PM||||I've met a lot of great Fiero people. What gets me is, when I'm driving down the road and see another Fiero, I give a little wave.  Just to acknowledge his/her car.  More often than not, they just look at me funny rather than return the wave.  I guess there's a lot of Fiero owners out there who aren't enthusiasts.  I figure out how, cuz drivin' one would make most people enthusiasts, but truth is stranger than fiction.  I'll keep on waving, cuz once in a while I get one in return.  Usually when I'm passing LZeitgeist...   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>We all come into this world the same way; naked, screaming, and covered in blood.  If you're lucky, it doesn't have to end there.||||reg||1
